{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-localized-hadron","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:localized-hadron","kind":"definition","title":"Localized hadron","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-hadron"],"tags":["hadron","knot","localized","categorical"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.LocalizedHadron","text":"localized-hadron.md","leanSource":"localized-hadron.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:localized-hadron\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code> be a categorical point of the projective line <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{P}(V)</code>. A <strong>localized hadron</strong> at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code> is a morphism in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  H_p  \\colon  \\mathbf{1}\n   \\longrightarrow \n  \\mathrm{Sym}^n\\!\\bigl(\\mathcal{K}_p\\bigr)\n  \\otimes\n  \\mathcal{L}_{p}^{\\mathrm{bind}}</code></pre>\n<p>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{K}_p</code> denotes the fibre of knot types at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{L}_{p}^{\\mathrm{bind}}</code> is the binding Hopf link at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">p</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/localized-hadron.md","heading":"Definition","number":"9.3.10","page":"b/def-localized-hadron","qa":{"counts":{"pass":75,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":16,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.LocalizedHadron","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/localized-hadron.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
